{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true,"title":"Search menus"},"description":"Find dishes and drinks by name on the menus Dim Hour has verified from venues' own sites, in one city. Each result names the venue, the dish, its printed price (null when the menu prints none), the menu and section, and source_line, the same source and check date the venue page prints. Only verified menus are searched: a venue whose menu nobody has verified never appears, so zero results means no verified menu lists the dish, not that no venue serves it. Terms match at word starts, in the dish name first and then its description (matched_in says which). Past 90 days a menu is stale and its rows say so. At most 50 results per call. Prices and dishes change: confirm with the venue before relying on them.","execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"},"inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"city":{"description":"City name or key","type":"string"},"limit":{"description":"Results to return (default 20)","maximum":50,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"},"query":{"description":"A dish or drink, e.g. 'guacamole', 'espresso martini'","type":"string"}},"required":["city","query"],"type":"object"},"name":"search_menus","outputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"city":{"type":"string"},"city_name":{"type":"string"},"policy_version":{"type":["string","null"]},"query":{"type":"string"},"reasons":{"items":{"type":"string"},"type":"array"},"receipt":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"abstained":{"type":"boolean"},"age_days":{"anyOf":[{"type":"integer"},{"type":"null"}]},"as_of":{"type":["string","null"]},"as_of_scope":{"type":"string"},"reason":{"type":["string","null"]},"scope_note":{"type":["string","null"]},"source":{"type":"string"}},"required":["as_of","as_of_scope","source","abstained","age_days","reason"],"type":"object"}